// TDS composition manifest — MyApp solution
// ==========================================================================
// SpecTree TDS composition manifest, grammar version 1 (ADR-0021).
// Declares which sources assemble into the MyApp Technical Design
// Specification, in which order, under which inclusion/exclusion rules, and
// for which rendering targets.  Parsed by scripts/generate-tds-composition.py;
// the parsed shape is published as
// spectree/schemas/tds-manifest-v1.schema.json.
//
// Line grammar:
//   // comment
//   # TDS: <title>                      — required, exactly one
//   ## Solution: <manifest-file-name>   — required; spectree/specs/<name>
//   ## Version: <semver>                — required; TDS document version
//   ## Target: <kind> (key: value, ...) — repeatable; kinds: mkdocs,
//                                         techdocs, standalone
//   ### Section: <title>                — repeatable, ordered, unique
//   - Source: <glob>                    — repeatable; paths relative to
//                                         the pipeline root (example/)
//   - Source: <glob> (generated)        — pipeline-generated artefact;
//                                         never blob-bound (its integrity
//                                         derives from the deterministic
//                                         build, ADR-0013/0015)
//   - Selector: <artefact>#<node-type>  — AST node selector over a
//                                         generated JSON artefact
//   - Rule: <phrase>                    — inclusion/exclusion rule from
//                                         the fixed vocabulary
// ==========================================================================

# TDS: MyApp Technical Design Specification
## Solution: myapp.manifest
## Version: 1.0.0

## Target: mkdocs (nav: Traceability)
## Target: techdocs (publisher: docs)
## Target: standalone (path: docs/generated/tds)

### Section: Home
- Source: docs/index.md

### Section: Requirements
- Source: docs/requirements/*.md
- Rule: summarize wont requirements

### Section: Architecture
- Source: docs/architecture/*.md
- Selector: docs/generated/traceability/metadata-v1.json#component

### Section: Infrastructure
- Source: docs/infrastructure/*.md
- Source: docs/network/*.md
- Source: docs/kubernetes/*.md
- Source: docs/configuration/*.md
- Source: docs/dsc/*.md
- Source: docs/generated/*.md

### Section: Application
- Source: docs/application/*.md
- Source: docs/generated/dotnet-api/*.md (generated)
- Source: docs/generated/tds/dotnet-api/*.md (generated)
- Source: docs/generated/openapi.json (generated)
- Rule: detail public api
- Rule: exclude test projects
- Selector: docs/generated/traceability/metadata-v1.json#test-suite

### Section: Compliance
- Source: docs/compliance/*.md
- Source: docs/security/*.md

### Section: FinOps
- Source: docs/finops/*.md

### Section: Architecture Decisions
- Source: docs/adrs/*.md
- Rule: appendix superseded adrs
- Rule: exclude deprecated adrs
- Selector: docs/generated/traceability/metadata-v1.json#adr

### Section: Traceability
- Source: docs/traceability/*.md
- Selector: docs/generated/traceability/metadata-v1.json#requirement
- Selector: docs/generated/traceability/metadata-v1.json#policy

### Section: Backstage
- Source: docs/backstage/*.md

### Section: Operations
- Source: docs/runbook/*.md

### Section: Developer Guide
- Source: docs/onboarding/*.md
- Source: docs/doc-review/*.md
- Source: docs/versioning/*.md
